This licence covers the code, tests and documentation written by the team.
It does not cover the data and third-party works the software uses, which keep
their own terms and credits (see README.md "Credits"):

- SPHEREx images and flag planes from NASA/IPAC IRSA; known-object positions
  from JPL Small-Body Identification and Horizons; Gaia DR3 from ESA/Gaia/DPAC.
- The all-sky backdrop: NASA/Goddard Space Flight Center Scientific
  Visualization Studio, Deep Star Maps 2020 (Gaia DR2: ESA/Gaia/DPAC), used
  under NASA's media usage guidelines, with no NASA endorsement implied.
- The saved SPHEREx fields in app/data/snapshots/ are derived from the IRSA
  and JPL data above and carry the same provenance.
- three.js (MIT) and Aladin Lite (CDS, GPL/LGPL) are loaded from public CDNs
  at run time and are not part of this repository.
